{"3555740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bandwagon", "steam_appid": 3555740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4763130], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The King has cursed the kingdom to silence, turning the animals of the kingdom grumpy. It's up to you to bring back the tunes, and assemble a big band to win over the King for good. In this survivors-lite adventure you'll play as brave little Drumbo, marching to the beat of your own drum. Assemble a band of animal instrumentalists as you explore an open world where each day brings new surprises.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/880f2a3405ddaa7db60670850868c38c.poster.avif?t=1784968890\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/880f2a3405ddaa7db60670850868c38c.webm?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/880f2a3405ddaa7db60670850868c38c.mp4?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Band Together &amp; Jam Out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit from a growing roster of cute animals, each with their own instruments, personalities, and musical combat styles. Every note your band plays doubles as an attack against the grumpiness. Each run you'll build unique, procedurally generated music based on the bandmates and upgrades you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/07c509963b49ae865f186c8bbcc311aa.poster.avif?t=1784968890\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/07c509963b49ae865f186c8bbcc311aa.webm?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/07c509963b49ae865f186c8bbcc311aa.mp4?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Day, New Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each bite-sized day is a new chance to complete quests, explore different regions, and set off with fresh objectives. Every run provides items to build out your island and unlock new powers so nothing you do is ever wasted. Will you use today to gather materials, save a squirrel from a cult, or befriend a giant snoring pig?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/2e760124b33f023e1dc98c35345d7c44.poster.avif?t=1784968890\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/2e760124b33f023e1dc98c35345d7c44.webm?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/2e760124b33f023e1dc98c35345d7c44.mp4?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Land of the Grumps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through dark forests, flowery hills, and mysterious villages, all rendered in a warm, comic-book art style. Unlock hidden passages, clear regional bosses, and recruit more musically-inclined friends as you make your way toward the concert that could finally cheer up the King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/e16950d6b2fd36b9c72fbc0280555699.poster.avif?t=1784968890\" width=1170 height=530 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/e16950d6b2fd36b9c72fbc0280555699.webm?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/e16950d6b2fd36b9c72fbc0280555699.mp4?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Aboard the Bandwagon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is a quest without a base camp?! You'll be using this space at the start of each day to upgrade your skills, unlock new abilities, build out friendships, and more. As musicians move in and settle down, watch your camp grow from a quiet clearing into a bustling home.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The King has cursed the kingdom to silence, turning the animals of the kingdom grumpy. It's up to you to bring back the tunes, and assemble a big band to win over the King for good. In this survivors-lite adventure you'll play as brave little Drumbo, marching to the beat of your own drum. Assemble a band of animal instrumentalists as you explore an open world where each day brings new surprises.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/880f2a3405ddaa7db60670850868c38c.poster.avif?t=1784968890\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/880f2a3405ddaa7db60670850868c38c.webm?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/880f2a3405ddaa7db60670850868c38c.mp4?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Band Together &amp; Jam Out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit from a growing roster of cute animals, each with their own instruments, personalities, and musical combat styles. Every note your band plays doubles as an attack against the grumpiness. Each run you'll build unique, procedurally generated music based on the bandmates and upgrades you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/07c509963b49ae865f186c8bbcc311aa.poster.avif?t=1784968890\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/07c509963b49ae865f186c8bbcc311aa.webm?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/07c509963b49ae865f186c8bbcc311aa.mp4?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Day, New Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each bite-sized day is a new chance to complete quests, explore different regions, and set off with fresh objectives. Every run provides items to build out your island and unlock new powers so nothing you do is ever wasted. Will you use today to gather materials, save a squirrel from a cult, or befriend a giant snoring pig?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/2e760124b33f023e1dc98c35345d7c44.poster.avif?t=1784968890\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/2e760124b33f023e1dc98c35345d7c44.webm?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/2e760124b33f023e1dc98c35345d7c44.mp4?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Land of the Grumps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through dark forests, flowery hills, and mysterious villages, all rendered in a warm, comic-book art style. Unlock hidden passages, clear regional bosses, and recruit more musically-inclined friends as you make your way toward the concert that could finally cheer up the King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/e16950d6b2fd36b9c72fbc0280555699.poster.avif?t=1784968890\" width=1170 height=530 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/e16950d6b2fd36b9c72fbc0280555699.webm?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/extras/e16950d6b2fd36b9c72fbc0280555699.mp4?t=1784968890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Aboard the Bandwagon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is a quest without a base camp?! You'll be using this space at the start of each day to upgrade your skills, unlock new abilities, build out friendships, and more. As musicians move in and settle down, watch your camp grow from a quiet clearing into a bustling home.</p>", "short_description": "An open-world survivors-lite adventure about building a band and restoring joy to a grumpy world. Assemble unique musical troupes, roam the land fighting off grumps, and complete quests for a growing cast of quirky characters.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555740/f3b5cdc1966ad7907cf5a0ce891fecf432bdd30a/header.jpg?t=1784968890", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35557